<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan seeks 4,500 T palm oil, 2,500 T olein.</title>
<headline>Pakistan seeks 4,500 T palm oil, 2,500 T olein.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-run Trading Corporation of Pakistan (TCP) tendered on Wednesday for 4,500 tonnes of RBD palm oil and 2,000 tonnes of RBD olein for shipment by December 10, traders said.  </p>
<p>They said the bids called on behalf of the state-run Ghee Corporation of Pakistan would be opened on Thursday at 0630 GMT.</p>
<p>One trader said Pakistan was seeking palm oil at around $516 a tonne and olein at $536 a tonne.</p>
<p>-- Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192</p>
